              "value": "kpi.corrective_action_close_rate@v1, kri.corrective_action_overdue@v1",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Extract corrective actions from the review artifact and register each one with owner, due-date, and verification clause. Registration is the deliverable here \u2014 execution and verification of each action are out of scope for this playbook (they live on the operator's existing change / ticketing system). Produces __corrective_action_register__.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
